# maid-leak-audit as a systemd user service, run by maid-leak-audit.timer (docs/audit-trail.md). Written by
# `maid audit-trail schedule install` from contrib/systemd/; `maid audit-trail schedule remove` takes it away.
[Unit]
Description=MAID leak audit over the audit trail and session transcripts (local judge only)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=MAID_BIN=@MAID@
ExecStart=@EXEC@
Nice=10
